Association FeederSchoolAssociation
    documentation 'The association from feeder school to the receiving school.
    domain entity School
        documentation 'Reference to the feeder school.
        with context Feeder
    domain entity School
        documentation 'Reference to the receiving school.
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'The month, day, and year of the first day of the feeder school association.
        is part of identity
    date EndDate
        documentation 'The month, day, and year of the last day of the feeder school association.
        is optional
    shared string Description named Description
        documentation 'Describes the relationship from the feeder school to the receiving school, for 
                      'example by program emphasis, such as special education, language immersion, 
                      'science, or performing art.
        is optional
        with context FeederRelationship